  {
   "sid": "7-02.s1",
   "text": "One: walk 048 further.",
   "w_first": "7-02.w001",
   "w_last": "7-02.w004",
   "f0": 9,
   "f1": 166
  },
  {
   "sid": "7-02.s2",
   "text": "It's public now, so anyone could try.",
   "w_first": "7-02.w005",
   "w_last": "7-02.w011",
   "f0": 202,
   "f1": 342
  },
  {
   "sid": "7-02.s3",
   "text": "Test it in more liver cancer cells and normal liver cells, then animals, and check how the body handles it and what else it hits.",
   "w_first": "7-02.w012",
   "w_last": "7-02.w036",
   "f0": 381,
   "f1": 890
  },
  {
   "sid": "7-02.s4",
   "text": "The authors had already listed these steps.",
